    trace.string_literal("##esp_dormant_dist");
    trace.string_literal("##players_settings");
    trace.string_literal("##visuals_max_dist");
    trace.string_literal("Color##esp_off_col");
    trace.string_literal("Color##esp_tgt_col");
    trace.string_literal("Color##esp_skel_col");
    trace.string_literal("Color##esp_snap_col");
    trace.string_literal("esp_target_highlight");
    trace.string_literal("Visuals draw distance");
    trace.string_literal("Color##esp_dormant_col");
    trace.string_literal("Target##esp_snap_tmode");
    trace.string_literal("esp_target_recolor_box");
    trace.string_literal("Draw for##esp_snap_mode");
    trace.string_literal("Origin##esp_snap_origin");
    trace.string_literal("esp_target_recolor_skel");
    trace.string_literal("esp_target_recolor_text");
    trace.string_literal("Trigger mode##esp_tgt_mode");
    trace.string_literal("Aimbot is off - no target, no lines.");
    trace.string_literal("Line from a screen edge to each player.");
    trace.string_literal("Bone lines over each player (hitbox skeleton).");
    trace.string_literal("Arrows at the screen edge pointing to players out of view.");
    trace.string_literal("Highlight the player/NPC you are aiming at or locked onto.");
    trace.string_literal("Hide boxes on corpses. Chams, glow, look beams and the aimbot");
    trace.string_literal("Keep drawing players the server has stopped transmitting.\\nTheir box freezes where they were last seen.");
    trace.string_literal("Boxes, bars and texts are arranged in the ESP editor (sidebar) - drag elements straight onto the model there.");
    trace.string_literal("Culls every player visual - ESP box, texts, bars, chams, look beams - beyond this distance. 0 = unlimited. Lower it on crowded servers to save FPS.");
    trace.string_literal("Locked - the player the aimbot is actually aiming at\\nwhile the aim key is held (silent aim included).\\nFOV candidate - who it WOULD pick right now.");
    trace.string_literal("All players - unchanged.\\nAimbot target - one line, to whoever the aimbot / silent aim is on.\\nInside aimbot FOV - only players within the aimbot FOV circle.");
    trace.string_literal("Paint every ESP text element of the target (name, job, weapon,\\ndistance, ...) with the color above. Off by default.\\nBeats a Team / Usergroup / Friend text color, like the box does.");
    trace.string_literal("How far the dormant reveal reaches. 0 = unlimited.\\nThe stalest boxes are the far ones: a low value keeps the ghost\\nof someone who just went round a corner, and drops the half-server\\na transmit optimizer dropped.");
    trace.string_literal("Show players hidden via NODRAW / ShouldDraw=false\\n(hoverboard riders, cloak SWEPs, some seats, distance-fog addons),\\nand put their MODEL back into the render - chams/glow work on them again.\\n\\nCannot help with dormant players: the engine refuses to draw\\nwhat the server is not transmitting.");
    trace.string_literal("Paint dormant players - box, skeleton and every text - with the\\ncolor below, so a stale box is never mistaken for a live one.\\nWins over Team / Usergroup / Friend colors, loses to the aim target.\\n\\nWorks on any dormant player on screen, including ones held by the\\ngrace window, not only the ones this toggle reveals.");
    trace.string_literal("In FOV Candidate - a real aimbot scan (bones, hitscan, visibility\\ntraces) once per tick. Exact, but it is the expensive one.\\n\\nIn FOV (fast) - screen-space only: the player whose box is nearest\\nthe crosshair inside the FOV circle. Same team/friend/dormant\\nfilters, no bone setup and no traces, so it costs almost nothing.\\nIt can disagree with the aimbot behind cover or with a hitbox filter.");
