    trace.string_literal("Outline through walls##ent_glow_thr");
    trace.string_literal("Outline (shared with Visuals -> Chams)");
    trace.string_literal("Sharp border (no glow)##ent_glow_sharp");
    trace.string_literal("Show model through walls##ent_glow_xray");
    trace.string_literal("Pick a class on the left, then press Add.");
    trace.string_literal("Fill material (shared with Visuals -> Chams)");
    trace.string_literal("Press Add to create a profile for this class.");
    trace.string_literal("Typed patterns work too: npc_*, item_health*.");
    trace.string_literal("Colour of the part behind geometry. Per profile.");
    trace.string_literal("Colour of the part in line of sight. Per profile.");
    trace.string_literal("The coloured border itself. Off + \\\"Show model\\\" on = model only.");
    trace.string_literal("On: wide soft halo. Off: crisp border - pair it with thickness 1-2.");
    trace.string_literal("Colours the covered part of the entity too, in the \\\"hidden\\\" colour.");
    trace.string_literal("In-game: aim at an entity and press this key to add\\nits class to the list. Works with the menu closed.");
    trace.string_literal("Redraws the entity\\'s own textured model with the depth suppressed,\\nso you see it behind geometry. Independent of the border.");
    trace.string_literal("Recolors the MODEL of every entity of this class.\\nIndependent of the player chams toggle; the fill material\\nis the one picked in Visuals -> Chams.");
    trace.string_literal("Freezes animated hitbox bones in the model\\'s reference pose.\\nEnable for rotors/propellers if the box jitters.\\nLeave disabled for articulated vehicles such as the jeep.");
    trace.string_literal("No blur: the silhouette is grown by a fixed number of pixels and its\\ninside is cut out, so the border is hard-edged and evenly thick.\\nA style of its own costs one extra screen-space pass per frame.");
    trace.string_literal("Solid: two-color silhouette, punches through walls.\\nOutline: coloured border around the entity (and the real\\nmodel through walls) - the same pass the player chams\\n\\\"Outline\\\" mode uses, works with gmod_mcore_test 1.");
    trace.string_literal("Keeps the box after the server stops sending the entity.\\nServers with a transmit optimizer (Prometheus and similar)\\ndrop distant entities from the client entirely - the box then\\nfreezes at the last position it was seen at, dimmed.\\nExact for static props like money printers; anything that\\nmoves while untransmitted is drawn where you last saw it.");
